{"4498540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spooky's Playground", "steam_appid": 4498540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/d1a43b2151d8e123472e52aac5ad3cae.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky’s Playground</strong> is a <strong>throwback to Arcade HighScore games; </strong>set in a colorful, cartooney sandbox. Your goal is simple: <strong>complete all objectives as fast as possible</strong>; getting faster each time you do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through different levels with unique settings, using physics, your creativity and the environment to your advantage. Every strategy can be a shortcut, every mistake costs time, and every quest is a chance to optimize your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/2fdcf21a1040848e7d5d3007e10b6e29.poster.avif?t=1782753393\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/2fdcf21a1040848e7d5d3007e10b6e29.webm?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/2fdcf21a1040848e7d5d3007e10b6e29.mp4?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/1b0204594ca619ef28f3631043e0d7b4.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do It, Do It Again, Do It Faster!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment, discover faster strategies, and express yourself through speed and precision. With our <strong>Global and Friend Leaderboards</strong>, Spooky’s Playground is all about <strong>being faster than everyone else, even yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/cb1606d1fea7673bbf7581730366bc1e.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=696 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Scoring system takes into account all of the objectives you complete, and how fast you complete them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, Speed is always Key!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/3d74fc7734027cb8eff0daea7382ab1c.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Throwback to the Golden Era of Gaming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all of the secrets hidden within our levels, for a chance to score higher than your friends. Curious players are rewarded for their out-of-the-box thinking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was born from our love of fast-paced arcade classics, so we understand how much it matters to pour <strong>detail and love</strong> into our creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We urge you to look for all hidden objectives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/5bd7afa05efb4534f62f46da9d9fccb4.poster.avif?t=1782753393\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/5bd7afa05efb4534f62f46da9d9fccb4.webm?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/5bd7afa05efb4534f62f46da9d9fccb4.mp4?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/c6c33028cbb19c328be56643eb3ec286.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make your way through the levels without being caught!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC's can't see you, but they can surely see things flying in front of them! Don't get caught, as you'll end your run on the spot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/ef214f37dd5a907ab35fe99fa0b210e5.poster.avif?t=1782753393\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/ef214f37dd5a907ab35fe99fa0b210e5.webm?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/ef214f37dd5a907ab35fe99fa0b210e5.mp4?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: levels designed to be replayed and optimized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-driven gameplay</strong>: Grab everything you can see and find interesting ways to solve puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Levels:</strong> different settings allow for maximum chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast restarts:</strong> Don't get slowed down by boring loading screens and unskippable cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller support on PC</strong>: play with your preferred input</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/d1a43b2151d8e123472e52aac5ad3cae.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spooky’s Playground</strong> is a <strong>throwback to Arcade HighScore games; </strong>set in a colorful, cartooney sandbox. Your goal is simple: <strong>complete all objectives as fast as possible</strong>; getting faster each time you do it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash through different levels with unique settings, using physics, your creativity and the environment to your advantage. Every strategy can be a shortcut, every mistake costs time, and every quest is a chance to optimize your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/2fdcf21a1040848e7d5d3007e10b6e29.poster.avif?t=1782753393\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/2fdcf21a1040848e7d5d3007e10b6e29.webm?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/2fdcf21a1040848e7d5d3007e10b6e29.mp4?t=1782753393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/1b0204594ca619ef28f3631043e0d7b4.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Do It, Do It Again, Do It Faster!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment, discover faster strategies, and express yourself through speed and precision. With our <strong>Global and Friend Leaderboards</strong>, Spooky’s Playground is all about <strong>being faster than everyone else, even yourself.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/cb1606d1fea7673bbf7581730366bc1e.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=696 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our Scoring system takes into account all of the objectives you complete, and how fast you complete them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Remember, Speed is always Key!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498540/extras/3d74fc7734027cb8eff0daea7382ab1c.avif?t=1782753393\" width=1560 height=200 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Throwback to the Golden Era of Gaming!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all of the secrets hidden within our levels, for a chance to score higher than your friends. Curious players are rewarded for their out-of-the-box thinking!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was born from our love of fast-paced arcade classics, so we understand how much it matters to pour <strong>detail and love</strong> into our creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We urge you to look for all hidden objectives!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.a